# ZWK Independent Reference Analysis

## Objective

Develop an independent reference from the ZWK pooled mass-spectrometry acquisitions using the original mzML data.

The intended analysis has two parts:

1. Identify peptides from MS/MS spectra using FragPipe.
2. Investigate and generate isotope groups (IGs) independently from MS1 evidence.

The existing XLSX isotope-group assignments are not to be used to construct the independent reference. They may be compared with the independent results later.

